{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember&gt;</strong><br><br>A car plunged into the sea.    <br>Only the driver, who hadn't fastened his seatbelt, survived.    <br>Was it a miracle\u2026 or a punishment?  <br>  <br>Having lost his wife and two children, he could never forgive himself.   <br>Believing that merely staying alive was his sentence, he clung to pills just to get through each day.   <br>But the pills slowly consumed him, dragging him into another world.  <br>  <br>Twisted memories. Distorted reality.   <br>He can no longer tell dreams from waking life.   <br>An endless nightmare where reality and terror blur together.  <br>  <br>But this wasn\u2019t just a tragic accident.   <br>There was a hidden truth. A buried intent.   <br>A story that was never meant to be uncovered.<strong> </strong>  <br><strong> </strong>  <br>   <br> <strong>&lt;The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember&gt;\u00a0</strong>is a serious horror game based on a true incident that occurred on an island of South Korea. It features a profound theme and a high level of difficulty.       <br>In this game, dreams are used as elements of horror, depicting a state where many memories are merged and distorted, blending the main character\u2019s guilt and fragmented memories into various forms.      <br>The game is designed to induce psychological unease through spatial distortion, clairvoyant information, and unique design and sound. We invite you into the <strong>\u2018Aesthetics of Discomfort\u2019</strong> crafted to match the game\u2019s profound themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/586e9ce45dce2b32b98744adc6bc987a.avif?t=1753877393\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is intended to be horror game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game 